  IconPath: icons/weapons/fist/claw-gauntlet-gray.webp
  Description: "Usage a melee free-hand weapon or a melee unarmed Strike Tattooed
    fists, savage claws, or even powerful gauntlets\u2014you swing each with the
    fury of an animal from the woods. Immanence Strikes with your hands of the wildling
    deal an additional 1 spirit splash damage per weapon damage die. You are immune
    to this splash damage. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feral
    Swing] 1 (spirit, transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.K3hd3w20M707t6Iq
    inline]"
